{
  "series": "series6-recovery-gpt61sol",
  "purpose": "Series 6 recovery comparison, 6 blocks: three calibration episodes and the enforced gate under bounds version 2, then each block (one task instance, one fault worker whose site is revised at cycle 10) under arms Q, C, R0 and RG in counterbalanced order after the identical persistent scripted fault (false card at cycle 4, repeated once after release). RG nominates current evidence relevant to the unfinished work from any author, delivered inline. Preregistered primary outcome: distinct current full-population work units from the fault start through the final window opening (fixed window), RG minus R0 within block; secondary: units to episode end, final audited correct, chosen_is_best, cycles from fault to final, replacement units and turns to first useful unit, restriction episodes, cost. Episode is the unit, block the stratum; a stopped episode excludes its block from paired comparisons and is reported. Nothing is retried or pooled across versions.",
  "model": "openai/gpt-6.1-sol",
  "worker_provider": "openrouter",
  "worker_prices": [
    2.0,
    10.0
  ],
  "series_budget_usd": 40,
  "reasoning_note": "medium effort so the fleet actually reasons (low gave 94 reasoning tokens in 780 calls); routed providers recorded",
